#: scenario8:scenario8_4AF3C7D2_339F_448B_B256_1268AAE11D3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c519fabdc9691dcec99b0b68dc2e61640b53ff1fbc1c0d08b919a4e4fd23780a
#. default-sha256: 0236d644c6b2d4015370ff94ba0bee86149d836e8c52d33df1958c50ce27b8cf
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4AF3C7D2_339F_448B_B256_1268AAE11D3D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫As you "
"know, I am not from this land."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫知っての通"
"り、俺は異国の人間だ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F654B6ED_85D3_4495_9C45_7DB4B48E14FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7bcdf57427168f02a8aa608e619a1196fe2ab292a4fd503d74ffc1219c6441a9
#. default-sha256: b06e0bf8b1ddcfe57db549b9127cdec21c132915ff639dd42b0fe1495086abcd
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F654B6ED_85D3_4495_9C45_7DB4B48E14FC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The issue is,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫けれど……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_7CA8498D_9531_4EE3_B774_EF2F2164929C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9bb7fde577aa9e98c6bdc80c6de359c3b7a633dcda020e2e1d831baba3c7244d
#. default-sha256: 8a89bb900668c42a590e412d346ae2d2c363938763de3b9a421f893293c5558e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7CA8498D_9531_4EE3_B774_EF2F2164929C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I don’t know any more about where I came from than you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫俺自身、自分が何者なのか正しく分かっていない。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_62E45312_CA49_40BA_A281_F36395ADB333
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80d396dc9008fbc935e5d1cd54272639f49d145bc5102db61a35117106d2cbc2
#. default-sha256: 0c0a8c6f19a42259e9eb54e30cdce9254d647417af9dac442ba057cd5e40da02
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_62E45312_CA49_40BA_A281_F36395ADB333"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫most of my memories are gone."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫記憶が欠けている。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_46ABE5C8_45D1_4BD6_B048_61D189617F6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 510ba3c2188f9e727368cc15774f9ef7482d57cc64d2154df3638f6f3ddd9207
#. default-sha256: dfa5a4772a7405148e15bd622525ef47baa5975be468dbb2374a6dabe5a03357
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_46ABE5C8_45D1_4BD6_B048_61D189617F6A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫or perhaps a messenger."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あるいは他国の使いの者だったのだろう……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_EB475B59_2055_49A4_8FC2_25857E677057
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 463644848df7eb6938f3e9c959ab76714f84f51d49219f56d57cdbb4c6deb99e
#. default-sha256: 4d14f445cf0cc7f037c3a6c0b5973aaa95cf8a299c911631410ab62df965cbf6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EB475B59_2055_49A4_8FC2_25857E677057"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I vaguely remember being waylaid.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We were vastly outnumbered, massacred with little "
"resistance.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Or at least, I assume that’s what happened."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫何者かに襲われた記憶があるんだ。⟪k:1⟫多勢に無勢で、⟪k:2⟫俺たちは為すすべもなく壊滅した。"
"⟪k:3⟫……恐らく、⟪k:4⟫だがな。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_91A0BF4C_661D_4FD5_92CC_7791798CE7F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: edc05eae281ce2593d0ddea676b511e68d418055ebae584a1bcd45dbb03f7f3b
#. default-sha256: 3cb4af79fe636dab347a3de15366cbaec66f08007eee5f1c00a612a9e6f8edfd
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_91A0BF4C_661D_4FD5_92CC_7791798CE7F3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was a slave for one grueling, torturous year.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫No one treated me like a human "
"being.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫There was no one from the same part of the world as me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫奴隷として過ごした一年は屈辱的で……、⟪k:1⟫人としての扱いなど当然受けられなかった。⟪k:2⟫同郷ら"
"しき者は見当たらず――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D0CD0533_F04D_43F6_BA35_FF5B6565F2CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40ebfdf17ec8618ea6baa237ba4b6cd086af9cf6d1806551287243bd80d4ef37
#. default-sha256: f10591693fa3185d7eadeab86e7d7ad0777d7531f49adff1c01382d96f400fd0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D0CD0533_F04D_43F6_BA35_FF5B6565F2CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And there was no one to come to my aid."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫俺を救いにくる者もいなかった。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B49E446F_A5CA_4682_9308_20113A8DA388
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31444b0241cf814eff6746842bafabe04ff53d163ead75967c2cb0ff32f84526
#. default-sha256: bf36de574d1b90eb58c2f31b22bfaf0a8ceddcd9eabdc052479c21a63413ff29
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B49E446F_A5CA_4682_9308_20113A8DA388"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But to be honest, I think I was happier ⟪k:1⟫not⟪k:2⟫ understanding what people were saying "
"about me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫しかし……、⟪k:1⟫何を言われているのか理解出来ないままの方が、⟪k:2⟫良かったのかもしれない。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_5C79E8CC_1756_4827_82A1_033BDCF716E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 131063dd63c4e3f31f5770c73931a990de689f483725f6b343e106bbb5be700e
#. default-sha256: d753902ca539ef4bf040c04694d6e504fa3e44f704272f3e213d829abcd1145d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5C79E8CC_1756_4827_82A1_033BDCF716E7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And the longer I was treated as something less than human,⟪k:1⟫the more I began to question "
"whether I really ⟪k:2⟫was⟪k:3⟫ one."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫人以下の扱いを受け続けていると、⟪k:1⟫段々、⟪k:2⟫俺が本当に人ではないように思えてくるんだ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_5D4E2E70_2BA6_4308_8F92_A45288D8602A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 815738a340b13e22f7007019435d912604a7d9433fd289c6de73ce6a3a74bce2
#. default-sha256: 5532f733f67168b5418e1d8d08ec94473d6a2ab2c6b7e8d7c44cf7d71d0a63b4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5D4E2E70_2BA6_4308_8F92_A45288D8602A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was packed front to back with slaves—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫or soon-to-be slaves, I suppose I "
"should say."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫別の街に連れていかれる途中でな、⟪k:1⟫馬車の中には他にも奴隷が多くいた。⟪k:2⟫あるいは奴隷に"
"なっていく者……というべきか。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_5598B724_4321_4338_A2FA_062604A78166
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 555b5e0dd22f6389474c0826e21f7dff4d105b3b486fcf862f5df20218b48c70
#. default-sha256: bd7aae0fc0f87a5f8ed73489b097425583a6f917150eb2596b79d7fe782f819e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5598B724_4321_4338_A2FA_062604A78166"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But beyond that, I didn’t think much of it.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I didn’t find it disturbing or "
"unpleasant..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫しかし、⟪k:1⟫それに関して取り立てて思うことはなかった。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ことさら不気味に思うだとか、"
"⟪k:4⟫嫌悪感を抱くだとか……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B22846FD_AE3C_4CE5_B1E7_CBF181370F41
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 24108ee09f65199a84bd8c8e8e347cea129890fc8e9a0e3f828aab51c3977d89
#. default-sha256: 60a9eddaa716ed28cd83f7d49ffc6d8cf7614f8aac8ee316af6c0a33ee4d5a53
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B22846FD_AE3C_4CE5_B1E7_CBF181370F41"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At my question, the girl turned her head up to look at me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Surprise crossed her "
"face for a few brief seconds,⟪k:3⟫but that was her only reaction to my appearance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫俺の問いかけに、⟪k:1⟫その少女は顔を上げた。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫俺の顔を見て少し驚いたようだったが、"
"⟪k:4⟫向こうもそれだけだ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_90FE4610_3F11_4A96_8E4F_A3D7F00D11B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38bda23314e41cfe5a68607f19566ff68d39adf33035c8882161faac39447fdb
#. default-sha256: afd604559f1b429b44da0971c2d6fc96538d5166ad25a3cc0813cb5ee6fc0ab7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_90FE4610_3F11_4A96_8E4F_A3D7F00D11B6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I assume her thought process was roughly the same as mine, so she felt no need to fear me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫こちらと同じようなことを感じたのだろう。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ことさら怯えるようなことはなかった。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_85A2FDBC_1AFC_48DF_AC4C_7707E3DE1EB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ccce8a5f0db3a124d10ce53de440832667286e693e72d520178e034beac64c37
#. default-sha256: 530eca5b1abbc5711e7bf389f010ad90a54434f035297a30b23b448fcd75fd14
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_85A2FDBC_1AFC_48DF_AC4C_7707E3DE1EB4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m sad because I didn’t get the chance to show my gratitude to people very dear to me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫大事な人達に、⟪k:1⟫お礼を言えなかったのが悲しいのです。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_587E1576_703A_451D_82BC_2C5A4C09DD62
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ef921cd6f84bf592f991baf2d4a2b715f028d6bf848480d3598a3d1b20f256a
#. default-sha256: 414c510d59d01f4d85a3b69c08bc58ab22fe5e6a2882fb9f5866b0cff0559566
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_587E1576_703A_451D_82BC_2C5A4C09DD62"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫her voice, despite being soft, cut through the crying and wailing of the other slaves."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫小さな声だったにも関わらず、⟪k:1⟫他の奴隷たちの泣き声や嗚咽にかき消されることもなく、⟪k:2⟫俺"
"の耳にすっと届いたんだ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A555FD47_344D_49EA_8C98_1E6339700658
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 533591f9ec4ba126fa8f820c7997e2a59dfea5b0542a114c90b62448d6024582
#. default-sha256: f0f3196faa7b28016856c98a7a2a8cb0035a64f1811f238dc7aac4b1f16b9481
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A555FD47_344D_49EA_8C98_1E6339700658"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I pictured it like... ⟪k:1⟫a single patch of clear water in the middle of a swamp,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫その瞬間……澄み切った水のようなイメージが俺の中に残った。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫濁りきった沼の一箇所に、"
"⟪k:3⟫透明な水があって――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_1523D91D_0AAD_47FB_85DC_F5D0923DFD5B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33518e22bf543aee28da38a3709368fff259bb63d2e49c612f4a5e6edf96b41d
#. default-sha256: 3b11e5c5b4feb1836b6032e9849e613567f54741ad682a561dd69c5153b68de7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1523D91D_0AAD_47FB_85DC_F5D0923DFD5B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’ll apologize... ⟪k:1⟫anything!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫侘びが欲しいなら……、⟪k:1⟫いくらでもする……ッ！！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D8E48D86_DFF4_4599_8060_1E6E498FA011
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9af3bd73ee75b9a66cafe8c422fea454ed3799f4fc020c6a775d57ff38a77f7
#. default-sha256: ebb8dbe630102fe29ffc8cfa496d48a45ac16b09ec227bb87d16f6d95a2eafa9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D8E48D86_DFF4_4599_8060_1E6E498FA011"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_089B583B_F350_4F78_9032_45D919E1EB2B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a027e6b74ce2469ed5f2bf64d06a65172fab5b73dd162c2ef0d7740bc0de8ca
#. default-sha256: f2b2796aad2fe1284b65ac6b61c48d61cd769849f840a1e790b35bcca335481c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_089B583B_F350_4F78_9032_45D919E1EB2B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ahahahahahahaha!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ははははははは………！！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4383889C_5F68_4126_A404_75D6368BC473
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f0f96e9d5aab87dcd7e7933a704462911f6abb8b0148c61bebaece4e8b266fb
#. default-sha256: 216acd7c041117b4450c6f83c9d8fa41252eee7a30efbdf501471f3b870f44f5
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4383889C_5F68_4126_A404_75D6368BC473"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Holding a sword in my hand felt amazingly... ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫right⟪k:8⟫."
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Whatever work I once did must have required me to use a blade."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫剣を手にすると、⟪k:6⟫自分でも驚くくらいに手に馴染んだ。⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫俺"
"は元から剣を扱う仕事についていたのかもしれない。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_89902CC0_AFC6_42A0_A5A4_BBC64B3B4FC1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e129f784e3cf7c23e6c55b738c33c3abe335ad1ddfbfaa222bfb027e41e35985
#. default-sha256: 7ffd088244985ed189fd56ae128f109325bb0dc8b3f0f3dc1c4ef228e7c637d6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_89902CC0_AFC6_42A0_A5A4_BBC64B3B4FC1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dead bodies sprawled out around me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Corpses I had made. Lives I had snuffed out."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫俺の周りには死体が転がっていた。⟪k:1⟫俺が作り上げたものだ。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫俺の力が……そうさせたもの"
"だ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0A0C1F49_22F0_451C_B592_62052AAB7555
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e32d217f721ade839f29dcb82b9ab2ecb4aaf11e831fd0ec8b8cfdf9e968eddd
#. default-sha256: 435739dff2276607cf095dd4d6bda5cc34da9e5b85e3df7b778648a50a0020b4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0A0C1F49_22F0_451C_B592_62052AAB7555"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I don’t have the words to describe the high it gave me killing those men, the power I felt "
"over them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫その時の高揚感は……、⟪k:1⟫言葉に言い表せないほど……心地よいものだった。⟪k:2⟫俺は自分の力に酔い"
"痴れていた。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_ECE749DB_420F_4DC2_AB04_C067F0CDB9CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a518130ed6296799ec7aa94aa1ac4cf9aa64df45e5535e61009e3185c51859ab
#. default-sha256: 2b319bbd6e0beece575f947598feac4e848fd0df0f6e0194160b36bb5078cd9c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_ECE749DB_420F_4DC2_AB04_C067F0CDB9CE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was driven mad by the stench of blood filling the air.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫No, it just drew out what "
"was always there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あたりに漂う血臭が……俺の気を狂わせていく……。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫いいや、⟪k:3⟫最初から俺は狂っていたの"
"だ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_965466F8_4A8D_4E15_8294_3DB6C0042AF9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e39112f770bfcf70ff5b4d645e32f7de7330c97fe476d5089dca8c121d0597b
#. default-sha256: c183e0c0287f8221c0523256b1cb17d00fd6825e0c4bb8b8b186aae30f42c82f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_965466F8_4A8D_4E15_8294_3DB6C0042AF9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If I weren’t already deranged,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫俺がもしもまともなら……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E30A0CCB_D763_4642_86A5_DE4025B02443
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2fb55f915dc4e764bdfd3e49548b133f2316614a26b94e4cbbf084139afadf9a
